version: 2.0.2
title: TOML errors
file: ./test/margot_test.gleam
test_name: toml_error_test
---
- syntax.i18n.toml: line 1, column 9: the string is never closed
- duplicate.i18n.toml: line 2, column 1: the key `a` is defined twice
- table.i18n.toml: line 3, column 1: the table is defined twice
- date.i18n.toml: dates and times aren't supported, quote the value to keep it as text
- float.i18n.toml: `inf` and `nan` aren't supported, quote the value to keep it as text
- number.i18n.toml: `count`: the value is an integer, expected a string or a map (quote it to keep it as text)
- array.i18n.toml: `list`: the value is a list, expected a string or a map (quote it to keep it as text)
- tables.i18n.toml: arrays of tables (`[[table]]`) aren't supported, a translation is a string or a group
- scalar.i18n.toml: line 2, column 1: the key `a` is a value, not a table
